Mono&quot;,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:14px;white-space:pre\">efa_output)</span></i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;S\\0000f6hne Mono&quot;,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:14px;white-space:pre\">\r\n</span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;S\\0000f6hne Mono&quot;,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:14px;white-space:pre\"><br></span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;S\\0000f6hne Mono&quot;,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:14px;white-space:pre\">It produced the following error:</span></font></span></div>&quot;error: &#39;extractEFAparameters&#39; is not an exported object from &quot;namespace:MplusAutomation&quot;<div><br></div><div>Thank you for your help.</div><div><br></div><div>Best wishes,</div><div><br></div><div>Catia<br><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(136,136,136)\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
