re-wrap\"><br></span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;S\\0000f6hne Mono&quot;,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">It produced the following error:</span></font></span></div>&quot;error: &#39;extractEFAparameters&#39; is not an exported object from &quot;namespace:MplusAutomation&quot;<div><br></div><div>Thank you for your help.</div><div><br></div><div>Best wishes,</div><div><br></div><div>Catia<br><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(136,136,136)\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;MplusAutomation&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>mplusautomati...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/mplusautomation/CACw%2BTfe4CUab24UwdZ2F2RhKsE7t7f-XkOHsC68cFFmn8PxAeA%40mail.gmail.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/mplusautomation/CACw%252BTfe4CUab24UwdZ2F2RhKsE7t7f-XkOHsC68cFFmn8PxAeA%2540mail.gmail.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487264243000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2VphFFDWBCFGb3oizmVOYG\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/mplusautomation/CACw%2BTfe4CUab24UwdZ2F2RhKsE7t7f-XkOHsC68cFFmn8PxAeA%40mail.gmail.com</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div></div></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n"
